  "description": "Alice Han is the personal secretary of the M&M global company's president in the 21st century. One day she ran into an accident, which was planned to murder her after she received a secret document from the president. When she opened her eyes, she was suddenly in the Joseon era, in the mid-19th century! And on top of that, she wake up as the concubine, Hong Seogyeong. Hong Soegyeong was unconcious after she accidentally fell into the pond in the castle. Can she discovered the mystery surrounding their accident?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MComics](https://www.mcomics.co.kr/webtoonComic/1752), [Mr.Blue](https://m.mrblue.com/comics_premium/cr/detail.asp?pid=urallie_wz), [Kakaopage](https://page.kakao.com/content/46613069)",
